 "remarks": "More freedom. More luxury. More living. Welcome to CHARLES COVE \" \"Leave the maintenance behind. Embrace the waterfront lifestyle.\" 1 Island Drive, Unit 20 | Charles Cove Exceptional Waterfront Living in East Norwalk Rarely available waterfront RENOVATED END UNIT in the prestigious Charles Cove community, offering magnificent sunsets, views toward Long Island Sound, and includes a remarkable 64-foot dock directly in front of the primary bedroom, placing the beauty of coastal living right at your doorstep. Completely renovated just 2 1/2 years ago, this sophisticated residence blends contemporary design with effortless comfort. The stunning open kitchen features quartz countertops, brand-new cabinetry and appliances, and a seamless flow into the dining and living areas, ideal for entertaining. Beautifully renovated bathrooms featuring soaking and jacuzzi tubs, sauna room, a custom-designed primary bedroom closet, new electric blinds, built-in cabinetry/shelving surrounding the fireplace, quality finishes, and thoughtful improvements throughout create a beautifully appointed, move-in-ready home.",
